      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d364c1284979e22e1a96f47|full_name}: Turning off your monitor actually heeds your performance, I've tested to see if simply having the laptop closed while  VRChat was running would boost performance. It causes stutters in FPS and decreases overall performance. So I would personally advise away from closing the monitor.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
